# api_comp environment (optional)
#
# The compose files need no interpolation variables: Traefik routing is fixed
# per stack prefix (see the router labels in compose/<stack>.yml) and every
# service receives its PORT / DATABASE_URL / POOL_SIZE from the service
# definition.
#
#   docker compose up                        -> everything (docker-compose.yml
#                                                 = aggregator over compose/)
#   docker compose -f compose/base.yml -f compose/rust.yml up -d --build
#                                            -> just Traefik + Postgres + rust
#
# Traefik dashboard: http://localhost:8080/dashboard/  (api.insecure, local only)
#
# The DigitalOcean rig (terraform/) reads its own config from terraform.tfvars
# — see terraform/terraform.tfvars.example. DO auth: `export DIGITALOCEAN_TOKEN`.